<!DOCTYPE html>
<html onkeypress="isKeyPress(event)" onkeydown="isKeyDown(event)">
  <head>
    <title><%= title %></title>
    <script src="https://use.fontawesome.com/8a92be1af5.js"></script>
    <script
      src="https://code.jquery.com/jquery-3.3.1.min.js"
      integrity="sha256-FgpCb/KJQlLNfOu91ta32o/NMZxltwRo8QtmkMRdAu8="
      crossorigin="anonymous"
    ></script>
    <link
      rel="stylesheet"
      href="https://stackpath.bootstrapcdn.com/bootstrap/4.3.1/css/bootstrap.min.css"
      integrity="sha384-ggOyR0iXCbMQv3Xipma34MD+dH/1fQ784/j6cY/iJTQUOhcWr7x9JvoRxT2MZw1T"
      crossorigin="anonymous"
    />
    <script
      src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/popper.js/1.14.0/umd/popper.min.js"
      integrity="sha384-cs/chFZiN24E4KMATLdqdvsezGxaGsi4hLGOzlXwp5UZB1LY//20VyM2taTB4QvJ"
      crossorigin="anonymous"
    ></script>
    <script
      src="https://stackpath.bootstrapcdn.com/bootstrap/4.3.1/js/bootstrap.min.js"
      integrity="sha384-JjSmVgyd0p3pXB1rRibZUAYoIIy6OrQ6VrjIEaFf/nJGzIxFDsf4x0xIM+B07jRM"
      crossorigin="anonymous"
    ></script>
    <link
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/icon?family=Material+Icons"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/stylesheets/style.css" />
  </head>
  <body
    background="/images/bg.jpg"
    style="background-repeat: no-repeat; background-size: cover;"
  >
    <div>
      <!-- <nav class="navbar navbar-dark" style="background-color: #1a4b6e;">
        <b><span style="color: white">To verify that you can use the virtual chat bot properly, you need to ask at least 4 questions during this 2 minute video. If you don't ask any questions during 30 second, then the video will pause and let you ask a question</span>
            </b>    </nav> -->
    </div>
    <br />
    <div class="container-fluid" style="margin-top:32px;">
      <div class="row" style="position: absolute;top: 60px;">
        <div class="col-md-3">
          <div style="background-color: #1a4b6e; padding: 16px; height: 100%;">
            <div>
              <h6 style="color: white; text-align:justify;" ;="" tabindex="0">
                Be sure you are using the Google Chrome browser for all testing
                activities - Remember to allow microphone access if prompted by
                the Google Chrome browser. This tutorial will introduce you to
                two types of video descriptions: Baseline descriptions =
                Baseline descriptions play automatically, provide general
                information about a scene, and read any onscreen text out loud.
                On-demand information = On-demand information is accessed using
                the InfoBot. The InfoBot provides information in two ways: as an
                image description or in response to a question. You will use
                different keyboard commands to control how you want to use the
                InfoBot.

                <br /><br />

                <br />
              </h6>
              <h6 style="color: white; text-align:justify;" ;="" tabindex="0">
                This tutorial will show you how to navigate both types of
                description while watching a video. Screen reader tips: Some
                screen readers use the CapsLock key as a modifier for a variety
                of screen reader commands If any of the kesy commands do not
                seem to work, press CapsLock+SpaceBar to toggle the navigation
                mode. This should allow the key commands to work as intended
              </h6>

              <h6 style="color: white; text-align:justify;" ;="" tabindex="0">
                Press I to start the tutorial.
              </h6>
            </div>
            <div></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-6">
          <h6
            style="text-align:center; visibility: hidden; color: red !important; font-weight: bolder;"
          ></h6>
          <div>
            <div
              style="margin:15px; font-size:15px; align-content: center; text-align: center;"
              font-size:
              15px;
            ></div>
            <div style="align-content: center; text-align: center;">
              <div
                class="overlay"
                id="player"
                tabindex="-1"
                style="pointer-events: none;"
              ></div>
            </div>
            <br />
            <div style="width: 100%;">
              <div
                style="width: 480px; height: 30px; padding:2px; margin: auto; border:0px solid black; background-color: darkgrey;"
              >
                <div style="float: left;">
                  <span id="btn-play-pause" style="visibility: visible;"></span>
                  <b
                    ><span id="elapsed_time">0:00</span>/<span id="total_time"
                      >0:00</span
                    ></b
                  >
                </div>
                <div
                  style="float: right; margin: auto; align-content: center; text-align: center;"
                >
                  <span style="visibility: hidden;">
                    <span><b>Auto-Pause at each scene: </b></span>
                    <span>
                      <label class="switch">
                        <input
                          type="checkbox"
                          id="btn-video-breakpoint-toggle"
                        />
                        <span class="slider round"></span>
                      </label>
                    </span>
                  </span>

                  <div style="text-align:center;visibility: hidden;">
                    <audio
                      id="myAudio"
                      style="visibility: hidden;"
                      controls
                      autoplay
                    >
                      Your browser doesnot support Audio.
                    </audio>
                    <audio
                      id="baselineAudio"
                      style="visibility: hidden;"
                      controls
                      autoplay
                    ></audio>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div style="align-content: center; text-align: center;">
                  <!-- <div id= "vischat"><button onclick="fetchKeyFrames()" style="visibility: visible;" class="btn btn-danger btn-l" id="btnDoubleTap">Click to Start the Visual Chatbot </button></div> -->
                  <div id="record" style="visibility: hidden;">
                    <button
                      id="record-button"
                      class="btn btn-danger btn-l"
                      style="margin:10px;width:300px"
                    >
                      Ask Question
                    </button>
                  </div>
                  <div
                    id="question"
                    type="text"
                    style="visibility: visible;text-align: center;"
                    placeholder="Start typing question here ..."
                    autocomplete="off"
                  ></div>
                  <p id="demo" style="visibility: hidden;"></p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div style="visibility: hidden;">
                <div style="height:80%; background-color:#fff;">
                  <div
                    class="list-container"
                    data-scene-details=""
                    style="height: 100%"
                  >
                    <ul id="ul-scene-list" class="scene-list"></ul>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div style="background-color: #1a4b6e;color:#fff;">_</div>
                <br />
                <button class="btn btn-danger btn-l" id="btnSubmit">
                  Save &amp; Close Window
                </button>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <script src="/javascripts/tutorialSteps.js"></script>
    <script src="/javascripts/onDemandTutorial.js"></script>
    <script src="/javascripts/visdial.js"></script>
    <script src="/javascripts/speechtotext.js"></script>
    <script src="/javascripts/handleCtrlEvents.js"></script>
    <script src="https://www.youtube.com/iframe_api" async></script>
  </body>
</html>
